{
  "bookId": "hero-213006",
  "id": "bond-26050",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26050001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这栋房子是送你的礼物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26050002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "谢谢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26050003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你似乎并不惊讶？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26050004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "我早预料到有这一天。\n但没想到，你会准备如此贵重的礼物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26050005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "我很高兴，这表明了你的诚意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26050006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "......诚意？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26050007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "这份拜师礼，我收下了。\n我会将武道的精髓尽数传授给你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26050009",
              "text": "太好了！"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "26050012",
              "text": "我并不想习武。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26050008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26050009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "很好，我相信你的决心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26050010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "我会和你一同摸索、领悟——什么是真正属于你的「道」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26050015",
              "text": "听起来很难做到。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26050011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26050012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "无妨。武道精髓不仅在于拳脚功夫，更在于心境。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26050013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "修心养性，悟到属于自己的「道」，才能获得强大的内心。\n这是实现任何理想的必备素质。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26050015",
              "text": "听起来很难做到。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26050014",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26050015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "不必担心，我会陪你一同前行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "26050",
